tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p"},"3808":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","content":"Cómo Steam transporta una conexión Eco entre dos usuarios."},"3809":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-1","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#flujo","content":"Flujo"},"3810":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-2","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#conectar-manualmente","content":"Conectar manualmente"},"3811":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-3","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#sesiones","content":"Sesiones"},"3812":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-4","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","content":"Eco implementa una conexión personalizada sobre Steam P2P mediante `IConnection`. La clase interna `P2PConnection` convierte los buffers de Eco en paquetes enviados al Steam ID remoto. fileciteturn190file0"},"3813":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-5","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#flujo","content":"El gameplay no necesita cambiar su protocolo sólo porque el transporte sea Steam."},"3814":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-6","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#conectar-manualmente","content":"La integración expone `Steam.Conectar(string)` para iniciar una conexión P2P mediante el Steam ID del usuario remoto. El README original de la integración utiliza un Steam ID numérico como ejemplo. fileciteturn189file0"},"3815":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-7","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#conectar-manualmente","content":"Si la cadena no representa un Steam ID válido, la integración no intenta tratarla como una conexión P2P y Eco puede continuar con su flujo normal."},"3816":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-8","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#sesiones","content":"La integración registra conexiones abiertas y cerradas y transforma la desconexión P2P en un estado de conexión que Eco puede procesar. fileciteturn190file0"},"3817":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-9","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#sesiones","content":"El transporte puede ser P2P, pero tu juego puede seguir siendo servidor-autoritativo. P2P describe el camino de comunicación, no quién decide el resultado de la partida."},"3818":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","type":"page","content":"Configuración","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Red","Red","Contenido","Steam"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion"},"3819":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","content":"Preparar Steamworks para utilizar la integración de Eco."},"3820":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion-1","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion#app-id","content":"App ID"},"3821":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion-2","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion#inicialización","content":"Inicialización"},"3822":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion-3","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/configuracion#callbacks","content":"Call