legir","content":"Característica"},"4298":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-20","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"TCP"},"4299":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-21","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"UDP"},"4300":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-22","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"Entrega fiable"},"4301":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-23","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"Sí"},"4302":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-24","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"No"},"4303":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-25","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"Orden de llegada"},"4304":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-26","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"Sí"},"4305":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-27","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"No garantizado"},"4306":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-28","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"Retransmisión"},"4307":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-29","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/t